Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.92,0:00:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Long ago, Gold Roger,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.96,0:00:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,the King of Pirates, obtained\Neverything the world had to offer,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.54,0:00:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,and his dying robes drove\Ncountless souls to the seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.40,0:00:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You want my treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.90,0:00:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You can have it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.20,0:00:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I left everything in one place.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.92,0:00:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you just have to find it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.24,0:00:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And thus a new age began.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.08,0:00:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the time known\Nas the Great Pirate Era!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.22,0:00:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm done playing\Nthrough with the waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.54,0:00:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way, I'm feeling alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.48,0:00:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.62,0:00:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine, here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.90,0:00:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise your flag up high.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.48,0:00:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hail a brand new dawn!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.42,0:00:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Blaze across the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.92,0:00:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to journey on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.92,0:00:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,On your mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.40,0:00:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Camel of other things.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.30,0:00:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, on Earth, a legendary.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.20,0:00:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.11,0:00:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can show your breath,\NThen we'll make some waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.86,0:01:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We run our daunted.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.46,0:01:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Ain't no beginners!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.70,0:01:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause if you want it,\NThen you're a winner!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.44,0:01:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,For we are on the cruise,\NAnd freedom is the only rule!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.74,0:01:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Fearless night and day!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.36,0:01:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause that's just our way!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.88,0:01:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Find one piece!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.28,0:01:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be the first!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.62,0:01:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard it be so bad, I could burst!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.50,0:01:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all this real!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.22,0:01:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be cause my hand's on a wheel!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.34,0:01:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done playing, filled with the waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.50,0:01:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,In a world I'm feeling\Nalive, but I'll be loud!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.32,0:01:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine, here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.62,0:01:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We have come so far!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.48,0:01:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta make it to the end!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.88,0:01:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever danger we find,\Nno one ever left behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.76,0:01:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I've always got your back, my friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.54,0:01:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sail on shoreward, keep marching forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.54,0:01:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreaming from the very\Nfirst day I'd make my name!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.20,0:02:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't you know that\Ndream hasn't changed!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.92,0:02:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done playing through with the wave!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.40,0:02:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,In every world I'm feeling alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.36,0:02:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out below!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.68,0:02:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.42,0:02:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.40,0:02:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.26,0:02:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,And here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.12,0:02:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.10,0:02:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ryugu Kingdom, come in!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.34,0:02:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the Border Patrol.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.06,0:02:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,A large, badly damaged ship is seeking\Nemergency entry into the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.84,0:02:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.58,0:02:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Just do your job and let them in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.18,0:02:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a little complicated, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.82,0:02:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It belongs to...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.28,0:02:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Celestial Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.26,0:02:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,In what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.10,0:02:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,King Neptune!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.98,0:02:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.16,0:02:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's the entry?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.60,0:02:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Send a rescue team right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.80,0:03:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go welcome them myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.42,0:03:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know he may!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.10,0:03:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What in the world is a celestial\Ndragon doing on the seafloor?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.10,0:03:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe this is happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.34,0:03:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Must have been attacked by\Na sea king or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.64,0:03:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's what I don't get.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.94,0:03:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,They hate us fishmen, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.76,0:03:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,So what were they doing sailing\Nthrough such deep water?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.88,0:03:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's help! You idiots!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.02,0:03:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,My whole worthless crew\Njust had to go and die!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.30,0:03:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring me a mask, you vulgar fishes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.92,0:03:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't tolerate your fish man's stench!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.58,0:03:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I demand that you bring me a mask!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.34,0:03:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you to save my life, filthy fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.64,0:03:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This creep's got zero respect for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.02,0:03:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,He thinks we're going to help\Nhim talking to us like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.54,0:03:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Doctor, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.60,0:03:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I need help! Are the medics here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.84,0:04:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah, they're here, but they're\Nnot sure if they want to help that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.14,0:04:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Put him out of his misery.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.34,0:04:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't deserve to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.22,0:04:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He's pure scum.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.04,0:04:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like something's\Ngoing on at the harbor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.98,0:04:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's a celestial dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.82,0:04:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.44,0:04:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like a world noble's causing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.80,0:04:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.96,0:04:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess his ship got wrecked, and now\Nhe's flipping his lid or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.48,0:04:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.62,0:04:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,This is guaranteed to be\Ngood for a few laughs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.24,0:04:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not how events\Nwere supposed to unfold.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.50,0:04:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The fishman slaves have been\Nallowed to return to their island?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.46,0:04:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,How can this be? Daddy dear!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.10,0:04:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's bureaucracy, my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.46,0:04:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The fishman pirate Jinbe\Njoined the seven warlords.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.18,0:04:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Then he brokered a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.06,0:05:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.74,0:05:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Jimbe was the captain of the sun pirates,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.00,0:05:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,the lowly thugs who'd\Nbeen hiding the slaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.76,0:05:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He negotiated to have their\Nevasion charges dropped
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.74,0:05:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,and obtained amnesty for\Nthe slaves to return home,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.82,0:05:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.06,0:05:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But if that's the case, then\Nthey aren't just any slaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.84,0:05:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Some of them are probably my\Nslaves, right, Daddy dear?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.82,0:05:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm certain of it, my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.12,0:05:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It turns my stomach to\Nthink they're living a
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.58,0:05:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,free and easy existence after\Ndisrespecting us. Fine, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.40,0:05:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just have to hunt them\Ndown and reclaim them, won't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.20,0:05:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only right,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.18,0:05:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,considering how much money I spent on\Ncollecting those slaves in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.28,0:05:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.56,0:05:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This should be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.64,0:05:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't anyone tell me the\Nseafloor was so unhospitable?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.86,0:05:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what do you guys think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.74,0:05:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.60,0:06:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Long time no see, Hamio's guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.50,0:06:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you address me without my title?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.28,0:06:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all my slaves!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.64,0:06:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,My personal property, you\Nmust return with me at
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.22,0:06:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,once do you hear I didn't\Npermit you to run free
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.64,0:06:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait don't do it you guys he's a celestial
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.26,0:06:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,dragon it'll avoid the\Namnesty if you kill him
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.12,0:06:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Put that gun down know\Nyour place you belong to me
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.20,0:06:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,and you will do as I say I'm your\Nmaster Your master! Up on the surface,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.48,0:06:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,all you have to do is cry and the admirals
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.84,0:06:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,will come running to you\Nat the drop of a hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.06,0:06:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You realize that's the only reason\Npeople are scared of you nobles.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.90,0:06:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But you're at the bottom\Nof the sea floor right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.68,0:06:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as the islanders stay\Nquiet, and trust me, they will.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.06,0:06:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever happens to you, they'll\Nthink it was an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.56,0:07:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, he's got a point there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.90,0:07:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll keep my mouth shut.\NMe too! Moms the one!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.00,0:07:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look at that creep!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.18,0:07:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He's barely even alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.30,0:07:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I might as well get it\Nover with right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.48,0:07:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,No, make it real slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.34,0:07:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He should suffer the same\Nway that you guys did.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.74,0:07:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.65,0:07:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Make him suffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.62,0:07:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give him any mercy. What? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.10,0:07:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought everyone respected me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.84,0:07:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't forgive you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.70,0:07:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Not after what you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.52,0:07:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Not until my dying day.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.98,0:07:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.89,0:07:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.81,0:07:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoot him!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.72,0:07:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,On this life!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.66,0:07:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.28,0:07:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just stupid fiend!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.50,0:08:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Queen Otolime!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.66,0:08:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, they shot the queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.70,0:08:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Queen Otohime, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.36,0:08:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, drop your guns at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.98,0:08:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Look around, children are watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.90,0:08:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Aladdin, I heard about\Nthe Celestial Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.12,0:08:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is he now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.03,0:08:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.95,0:08:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I just got here myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.46,0:08:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss Jinbe!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.96,0:08:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you seen our mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.36,0:08:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,She rushed out of the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.78,0:08:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,To come down here? Hey, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.36,0:08:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,These Celestial Dragons, who are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.70,0:08:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,They're not like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.84,0:09:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,They're humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.32,0:09:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Humans?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.96,0:09:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Not all humans in the\Nworld are bad, but these...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.50,0:09:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Are not to be trusted.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.40,0:09:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard some gunshots right\Nwhen I got here. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.80,0:09:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Queen of Tohime.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.12,0:09:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It only grazed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.10,0:09:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you protecting him?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.70,0:09:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You have no idea what kind of\Npain that man inflicted on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.20,0:09:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The hell he put us all through.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.16,0:09:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He treated us like we were nothing\Nmore than a bunch of animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.20,0:09:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.11,0:09:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I can feel the anguish in your hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.54,0:09:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I do not question that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.50,0:09:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Has mother been injured? Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.68,0:09:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it's difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.98,0:09:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But you can't pollute the children's\Nminds with your anger towards humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.28,0:09:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Your resentment.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.20,0:09:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not make it theirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.26,0:09:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,They deserve the chance to meet\Nhumans and make up their own minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.32,0:10:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, you can't tell them you have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.20,0:10:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,hold it in our tragedy and our hatred?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.58,0:10:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,They must die with us\Nthey were one in the same!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.00,0:10:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You stay still, your\Nmajesty? What is this? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.04,0:10:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.78,0:10:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.69,0:10:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.61,0:10:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.46,0:11:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,THE SEA KING! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.16,0:11:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.04,0:11:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,just happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.56,0:11:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That was no coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.84,0:11:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Shura Hachi, are you the one who did this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.98,0:11:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, Captain, you're really freaking out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.66,0:11:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The legend my family spoke\Nof for all those years.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.96,0:11:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,A mermaid gifted with mysterious powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.94,0:11:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,An almost supernatural ability that\Nallows her to summon and control.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.96,0:12:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,the sea kings.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.40,0:12:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I scoured the sea floor\Nsearching for the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.76,0:12:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Searching for traces on a stable mermaid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.92,0:12:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,My family was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.92,0:12:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Their dream was true.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.08,0:12:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I found her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.34,0:12:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You think Shirahoshi's
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.88,0:12:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,the legendary mermaid?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.20,0:12:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you'd find her, Captain. Shush.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.88,0:12:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No one else can find out about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.16,0:12:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a secret legend so\Nold that everyone has
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.84,0:12:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,forgotten about it except\Nfor my family. So I
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.74,0:12:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,suspect can you imagine\Nif I could get the sea
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.06,0:12:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,kings to do my bidding\Nnot a person alive could
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.58,0:12:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,stop me I could do\Nanything and take anything
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.42,0:12:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted so what's the\Nnext step in the plan
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.82,0:12:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,are we gonna kidnap\Nprincess Shirahoshi or what
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.30,0:12:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,of course not I simply\Nhave to make her my wife
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.66,0:12:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,you do realize she's still only a\Nchild don't you yeah that's the problem
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.90,0:12:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Aladdin
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.08,0:13:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll treat him if you wish my\Nqueen It's the right thing to do
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.88,0:13:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of your wound next.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.54,0:13:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,A few weeks later, once the\Ncelestial dragon's health
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.60,0:13:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,was stable enough for him\Nto travel home He prepared
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.56,0:13:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,to disembark for his voyage\NBut queen otohime did
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.94,0:13:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,something rather unexpected\Nbefore he could leave
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.76,0:13:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You will pay for this. You damn fish you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.52,0:13:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,insulted and humiliated\Nme despite the fact that
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.20,0:13:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a respected world\Nnoble your actions were
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.38,0:13:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,unforgivable and you\Nwill come to regret them
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.66,0:13:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,so we just saved his life\Nand then he turns around and
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.32,0:13:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,threatens us He's got some\Nnerve speaking to us that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.92,0:13:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We provided him with a\Nship and a crew to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.60,0:13:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell else does he expect from us?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.54,0:13:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We shouldn't even be\Nletting him leave anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.66,0:13:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a danger to the whole island.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.44,0:14:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.44,0:14:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It's evident to me that\Nyou have more to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.30,0:14:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'll travel to the world\Nabove with you to hear you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.62,0:14:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,She can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.62,0:14:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.90,0:14:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't go. Mother, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.82,0:14:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You must reconsider.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.12,0:14:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot allow you to face such danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.42,0:14:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,If you truly wish to negotiate with the\Nnobles, allow me to go in your place.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.34,0:14:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you'd be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.00,0:14:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the king and a great knight,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.52,0:14:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,so the humans couldn't harm\Nyou even if they wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.26,0:14:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That's precisely why I should...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.00,0:14:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.91,0:14:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no point in\Nsending a warrior like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.64,0:14:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a matter of appearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.64,0:14:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Our nation needs to see that\Neven someone who is as powerless
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.36,0:14:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,as I can travel amongst the humans\Nand then safely return home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.36,0:14:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.58,0:14:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Without fear, and with a heart\Nthat's full of trust, I'll go myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.12,0:14:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the only way that this can be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.18,0:14:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful, Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.54,0:14:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go, Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.90,0:14:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We're the behemoth!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.22,0:14:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.13,0:15:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is she going?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.04,0:15:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,My queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.38,0:15:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.29,0:15:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Have faith in the woman you\Nmarried, and the humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.86,0:15:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just the queen of a fish tank.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.82,0:15:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You arrogant trash!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.16,0:15:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.12,0:15:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's troubling.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.06,0:15:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe me I know how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.34,0:15:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But no one can stop her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.86,0:15:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,All we can do is have faith\Nand hope for the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.68,0:15:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Your majesty, please be careful out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.92,0:15:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Come home safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.56,0:15:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you, mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.02,0:16:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Her children were restless,\Nawaiting news of her safe return.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.60,0:16:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,In this, the island was\Nunited, whether we were
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.90,0:16:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,royalty or commoners all we\Ncould do was pray for our
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.00,0:16:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,queen what a magic box\Nyeah in the palace it's
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.78,0:16:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Called the tamate box, to be\Nexact, and it has the power.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.28,0:16:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,to make you suddenly grow\Nolder yep well that's
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.12,0:16:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,what they say at least so\Nthat means if a kiddo like
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.12,0:16:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,the princess opened it\Nthen bam she'd be a full
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.46,0:16:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,grown sexy babe lickety split\NThat would be the idea, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.30,0:16:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Problem solved!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.86,0:16:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,That is just what I need!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.66,0:16:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I can get married to Shirahoshi\Nright away and it won't be creepy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.18,0:16:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Or so I suspect.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.14,0:16:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.05,0:16:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Go and steal that magic box\Nthing and steal it quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.60,0:16:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,No, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.60,0:16:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That gate at the palace is\Ngonna stop us for sure, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.06,0:17:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I say you just marry her first\Nand work out the details later.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.24,0:17:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, everybody knows you're a creep.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.98,0:17:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.89,0:17:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Now there's an idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.40,0:17:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Shirahoshi is pretty cute already.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.84,0:17:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if the box thing doesn't work out,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.52,0:17:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,if I give it ten years or\Nso, she'll be a knockout.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.34,0:17:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but she's gonna get\Neven bigger, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.36,0:17:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.27,0:17:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Different strokes for\Ndifferent folks, buddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.62,0:17:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I happen to like big women just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.26,0:17:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Not to mention, she can control the\NSea King, so her powers are big, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.16,0:17:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,As big as my ambitions!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.22,0:17:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,She just needs the right man in her life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.84,0:17:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And we'll have the whole world\Nin the palm of our hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.98,0:17:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you it's my destiny!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.16,0:17:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The dream of every decade\Nsince the beginning of time!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.14,0:17:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, let's get started on writing\Nthose wedding invitations, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.44,0:17:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to propose to her first! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.34,0:17:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have any friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.18,0:17:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Days passed with no word from the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.32,0:17:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The hearts of her people grew heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.98,0:17:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I really miss hearing her speeches.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.36,0:18:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Please return safely, Queen Otohime.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.62,0:18:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.58,0:18:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Why isn't she back?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.28,0:18:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You think something bad happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.58,0:18:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep the faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.52,0:18:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,She is fighting to protect\Nyour future, children.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.24,0:18:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This island's future.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.92,0:18:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Our hearts are with you, your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.92,0:18:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Please come home.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.16,0:18:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Worry not, my children.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.80,0:18:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Your mother is a strong and wise woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.52,0:18:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Although it was but a week,\Nit felt like an eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.14,0:19:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,She's back!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.50,0:19:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.08,0:19:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I was so worried!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.12,0:19:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not crying, I just\Nhave something in my eye!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.30,0:19:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome home!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.98,0:19:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.64,0:19:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,After several days of negotiations,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.78,0:19:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Queen Otohime was able\Nto quell the fury of the
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.64,0:19:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,celestial dragons and\Nperhaps more importantly
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.18,0:19:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,she brought a piece of\Npaper back with her that
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.44,0:19:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,would prove a beacon of\Nhope to our entire island.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.94,0:19:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,In truth, it was a greater miracle\Nthan any of us could have imagined.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.60,0:19:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, despite our\Ntroubled history with them,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.82,0:19:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,the celestial dragons are very\Ninfluential and by meeting with them,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.80,0:19:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I have been able to bridge a gap.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.88,0:19:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We may attend the world summit,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.58,0:19:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,yet listen to what they've written to improve\Nhumankind's relationship with fishmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.08,0:20:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We give this petition written by\Ntheir queen our full endorsement.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.78,0:20:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, if we can fill\Nmy petition with signatures,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.96,0:20:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,the world leaders at the\Nsummit will have no choice
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.52,0:20:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,but to recognize our right\Nto be there and furthermore,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.72,0:20:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,our right to be a part\Nof the surface world.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.02,0:20:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.30,0:20:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,We will see our dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.76,0:20:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I have mixed feelings about\Ngetting support from those guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.66,0:20:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm still not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.90,0:20:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, it's in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.82,0:20:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We still need more signatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.08,0:20:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I have found the way, but this\Nis a path we must walk together.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.02,0:20:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, let your cry for freedom be heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.40,0:20:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Only then can we live above\Namong our human friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.06,0:20:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We've come so far. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.68,0:20:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, bud.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.59,0:20:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get my hopes up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.56,0:20:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're just going to\Nchange your mind again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.52,0:20:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.46,0:21:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,My mom said she's gonna sign too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.00,0:21:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,No offense, Majesty, but I think\Nyou're going to need a much bigger box.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.28,0:21:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And you better hurry, because the\Nwhole country's going to be lining up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.60,0:21:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Your Highness, I\Nhad a feeling this might happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.74,0:21:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Those of you who support our Queen,\Nput your signatures in here, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.18,0:22:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only so much we can\Ndo by ignoring our prejudice.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.10,0:22:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We need someone like her\Nto take a step forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.48,0:22:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We can denounce hate, but to\Ninstill hope is a far greater gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.84,0:22:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This is our future-given life,\Nsooner than we ever imagined.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.86,0:22:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,She can transform this island more\Nthan a life of fighting ever could.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.28,0:22:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish that Arlong understood\Nthat, to save him from hatred.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.54,0:22:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder, what will he\Nthink of our future?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.66,0:22:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish Tiger were here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.40,0:22:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely this would have warmed his heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.82,0:22:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a dream come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.62,0:22:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and your courage made it come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.70,0:22:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I did feel some inspiration.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.82,0:23:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I felt as if a new road\Nhad been paved for the
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.38,0:23:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,future of our people when that\Nmiracle happened. Miracle?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.04,0:23:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes what else could you\Ncall the appearance of
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.42,0:23:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,those sea kings that was\Nnuts think they like us
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.14,0:23:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,No Shirahoshi called them here I\Ndon't think it's so strange after
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.04,0:23:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,all we can speak to fish Can't\Nwe that's part of what it means
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.44,0:23:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,to be merfolk and yet whenever we\Ntry to communicate With the great
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.68,0:23:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,sea kings for whatever reason our\Nwords fall on deaf ears no one
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.52,0:23:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,on fishman island Can speak to\Nwhales except for your father but
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.62,0:23:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,the sea kings well they're beyond\Neven him they say In a legend
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.56,0:23:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,passed down by our family that\Nevery few hundred years a mermaid
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.36,0:23:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,will be born into The royal house\Nwith a fearsome power that no one
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.68,0:23:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,else on the island possesses the\Npower to talk to Sea kings and
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.86,0:23:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,shirahoshi is the one I believe\Nshe is and according to the rest
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.80,0:23:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,of the legend She will meet\Nsomeone who will guide both her and
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.84,0:24:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,her power in a direction that will\Nchange the world. I can't wait to
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.24,0:24:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,see oh wow of course if the world\Ndoes change then that will likely
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.32,0:24:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,mean A change to this island as\Nwell yeah you think it'll help
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.74,0:24:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,with the world summon thing you're\NDoing perhaps for if it is used
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.76,0:24:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,with love her power could save\Nthousands of lives that is my hope
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.76,0:24:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But who can say it may be\Ndarkness that will rule her heart
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.56,0:24:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Instead, in that case, her power\Ncould sink the world, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.26,0:24:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Shura Hachi is just a child I'm\Nsure she has no such intentions
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.14,0:24:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But because she is a child\Nshe has yet to understand her
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.06,0:24:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,power and cannot control it\NIf something traumatic were to
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.58,0:24:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,happen to her she could unwittingly\Ncause the sea kings to go
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.58,0:24:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,berserk And in great numbers\Nwhat then a whole island would be
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.96,0:24:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Smashed into itty Betty bits.\NWhat the heck should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.28,0:24:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.19,0:24:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You can count on me to take\Ncare of her for the time being.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.04,0:25:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Although, one of these days, the three of\Nyou must become warriors, brave and true.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.60,0:25:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, as warriors and brothers alike,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.68,0:25:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,use your strength to protect\Nyour sister no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.36,0:25:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah! But of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.50,0:25:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.10,0:25:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But even as they made that vow, they could\Nnot have expected what would come next.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.72,0:25:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Get away! Fire! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.56,0:25:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we under attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.86,0:25:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.77,0:25:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Water! Get water! Quick! Put it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.14,0:25:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Who would do such a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.68,0:25:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll lose all of the\Nsignatures at this rate!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.24,0:26:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, what a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.08,0:26:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, don't mind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.34,0:26:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing suspicious going on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.04,0:26:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you? No one!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.30,0:26:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay away from the princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.94,0:26:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.52,0:26:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, someone tell me she's on her own!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.70,0:26:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Say something!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.46,0:26:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.28,0:26:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit, no one does such a thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.46,0:26:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We need a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.52,0:26:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What's taking so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.58,0:26:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.58,0:26:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Answer me, Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.49,0:26:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, open your eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.88,0:26:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever did this, I'll make them pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.24,0:27:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm here, Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.32,0:27:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,My little angels, stay by my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.64,0:27:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,However you feel, you must remain calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.90,0:27:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I let my guard down.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.34,0:27:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I was so excited about all of the\Nsignatures, that I failed to protect them.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.06,0:27:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And look what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.36,0:27:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Dear Fukaboshi, let me suffer this anger.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.32,0:27:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, we're here to operate.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.68,0:27:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.50,0:27:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter who did this to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.62,0:27:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't become angry on my behalf.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.06,0:27:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.66,0:27:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't submit to resentment.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.74,0:27:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let hatred get the better\Nof you in my name or any other.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.56,0:28:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.47,0:28:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't play, Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.80,0:28:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Shirahoshi...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.71,0:28:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.12,0:28:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,If something traumatic\Nwere to happen to her,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.46,0:28:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,she could unwittingly cause the Sea Kings\Nto go berserk, and in great numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.60,0:28:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Again?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.06,0:28:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Sweetie, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.10,0:28:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Joshi, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.66,0:28:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.62,0:28:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Woo!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.53,0:28:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it the food fish, Mambo, Mambo,\Nshake it up high, shake it down low.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.10,0:29:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Mambo, Mambo, dry your tears,\NMambo, Mambo, never fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.38,0:29:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucci, Hachi!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.84,0:29:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it the food fish, Mambo, Mambo,\Nshake it up high, shake it down low.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.92,0:29:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's dance along! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.14,0:29:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, your brothers will\Nbe here for you wherever you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.02,0:29:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Do-re-mi-fa-so!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.66,0:29:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The moonfish rubble sure is fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.30,0:29:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.21,0:29:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It sure is fun, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.04,0:29:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Do-re-mi-fa-this is so very fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.64,0:29:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.55,0:29:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.84,0:29:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.40,0:29:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Get him out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.31,0:29:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.23,0:29:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, brother, we're happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.80,0:29:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't be angry at all,\Njust like you told us!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.04,0:29:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It will protect our little sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.12,0:29:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.24,0:29:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Just ask him to make it so much he does!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.00,0:29:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop struggling!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.44,0:29:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to calm down and\Nget back to the palace!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.86,0:29:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.24,0:29:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,the signatures that burned,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.14,0:29:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I will collect again.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.98,0:30:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And just like our father, your\Nsons will become noble warriors.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.10,0:30:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,With all of our strength, we will protect\NShirahoshi and body and spirit alike.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.32,0:30:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,So please, mother, Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.54,0:30:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You need not worry about us.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.34,0:30:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We are almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.86,0:30:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Our new home.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.54,0:30:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,In the light of the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.12,0:31:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,There he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.30,0:31:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The shooter's up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.50,0:31:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.60,0:31:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Get to the rooftop!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.94,0:31:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he the one?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.98,0:31:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is the Kerr? Boss Jinbe!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.52,0:31:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,One of our men just killed him, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.68,0:31:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it someone we know?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.26,0:31:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Far from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.32,0:31:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.28,0:31:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a human!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.80,0:31:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hide the body. Hold on. Do what if?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.54,0:31:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,this gets out it'll ruin everything
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.44,0:31:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The Queen has accomplished all of\Nher work. It will be for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.86,0:32:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,she'll never be able to\Nrest in peace maybe but
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.32,0:32:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,that still doesn't change\Nthe truth does it the
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.40,0:32:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,truth is that he was a\Nlawless pirate pirate or
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.94,0:32:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,no pirate all All that\Nmatters is he was human.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.20,0:32:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it be horny!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.58,0:32:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do it, damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.98,0:32:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.64,0:32:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a human!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.96,0:32:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,A human assassinated our queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.02,0:32:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what humans are capable of!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.22,0:32:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,KILLING AND CALL BLIND!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.42,0:32:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,She trusted them with all her heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.64,0:32:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,A human.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.38,0:32:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,All she ever wanted was\Na peaceful coexistence.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.90,0:32:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And this human murders her just\Nwhen she finally had us convinced.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.80,0:33:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We put all of our faith in her.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.46,0:33:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And he's stolen that from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.02,0:33:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,By taking Queen Otehime's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.28,0:33:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,He's taken our hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.76,0:33:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And the future of this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.78,0:33:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We could kill you a million times.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.02,0:33:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And never replace our queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.56,0:33:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You human.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.62,0:33:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there no justice in the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.10,0:33:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What joy can we find now?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.36,0:33:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's more than I can take.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.00,0:33:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,All I can see is despair.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.66,0:33:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,All I can see is regret.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.98,0:33:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Has the king agreed to\Nleave the tower yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.82,0:33:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Afraid not.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.84,0:33:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no reasoning with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.18,0:33:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He's so stricken with grief and rage.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.58,0:33:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He's lost all control.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.06,0:33:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,King Neptune.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.16,0:33:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Lock the door behind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.64,0:34:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,and leave it sharp until my\Nurge to kill Hector Sagan!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.74,0:34:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Gang Neptune, will you talk to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.72,0:34:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.24,0:34:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The shooter was discovered\Nwith the gun still in his hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.86,0:34:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,so one of our soldiers killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.80,0:34:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He was a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.78,0:34:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I would have torn off his limbs\Nwhether he were armed or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.16,0:34:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But my queen would never\Nhave allowed such savagery.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.14,0:34:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't even know when this all began.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.38,0:34:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But I would only perpetuate\Nit further by seeking revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.34,0:34:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,If the children of our nation were\Nto see me engage in such acts?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.00,0:34:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It would only teach them bitterness.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.64,0:34:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And show them that rage is the answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.06,0:35:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And this horrible bloodshed\Nwould spiral onward.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.50,0:35:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It was easy to empathize with\NOtohime's message of peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.54,0:35:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,So long as it was someone else's problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.58,0:35:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But now?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.36,0:35:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would it be wrong for me to kill\Nthe man who shot my wife to death?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.08,0:35:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is that not my right?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.54,0:35:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,As much as I want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.26,0:35:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I just can't understand that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.70,0:35:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,In my time as a soldier I took many lives\Nin reprisal from my fallen comrades.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.82,0:35:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And I've killed swarms of humans\Nover the years who besieged us.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.84,0:35:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But my hypocrisy kept me from\Nhelping Otohime in her endeavors.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.86,0:35:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,So I simply stood by her side and watched.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.56,0:35:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Why should she die while a beast\Nlike me is allowed to live?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.56,0:35:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I could never take over her work.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.32,0:35:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Because my hands are forever stained\Nwith the blood of my brutal history!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.64,0:36:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,My king, we're all teeming\Nwith contradictions.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.28,0:36:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And we all change with age.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.64,0:36:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That goes for fishmen and humans alike.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.08,0:36:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But there are some things that only a\Nsoldier can have the strength to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.80,0:36:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,King Nefk 'un!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.26,0:36:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for helping me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.38,0:36:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not certain if I'm ready, but at\Nleast I can attend my wife's funeral.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.06,0:36:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, you made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.84,0:36:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I meant you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.76,0:36:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Shigohoshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.92,0:36:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.42,0:36:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,My brave sons.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.56,0:36:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.92,0:36:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, children.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.46,0:37:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't have left you alone\Nduring such a terrible time.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.56,0:37:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You should see this, father.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.94,0:37:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.76,0:37:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it these letters\Nkeep flying after me? No
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.16,0:37:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,matter where i go she's\Nalready received five of
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.40,0:37:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Them father is this a\Nlove letter. Sheer is only
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.78,0:37:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,six years old who in blazes\Nis this van der decken
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.88,0:37:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,that's the name of a\Nlegendary pirate isn't it
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.14,0:37:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,sire my children will\Nnot attend the funeral?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.64,0:37:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,There could be an accomplice still\Non the loose for all we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.02,0:37:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, I want this sleazy, dick and\Ncharacter apprehended post-haste! Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.92,0:38:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,My kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.30,0:38:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Look up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.54,0:38:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Fukaboshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.64,0:38:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Then he isn't here?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.68,0:38:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What is he here?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.66,0:38:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuck a bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.76,0:38:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,In her last moment of life, my mother\Nhappily spoke to us of the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.48,0:38:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We have chosen to adopt our mother's dream
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.10,0:38:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,and dedicate our lives\Nto seeing it through,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.48,0:38:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,no matter how long it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.38,0:38:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,So noble.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.08,0:38:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We understand that you are not yet\Nready, and you likely won't be,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.48,0:38:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,for the World Summit in two years.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.80,0:38:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But there will be another in six\Nyears, and another after that in ten.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.28,0:39:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only natural for this tragedy to have
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.88,0:39:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,reaffirmed your deeply\Nheld mistrust of humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.68,0:39:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'll destroy the remaining\Nsignatures that were left unburned.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.92,0:39:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And together, we'll\Nstart from the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.68,0:39:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Someday in our future, when your\Nwounds have finally begun to heal,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.52,0:39:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you feel you are ready
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.70,0:39:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,United we will dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.68,0:39:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Of a new life in the sun?
